From: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 20:52:14 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add iOS vehicle D-pad touch controls

Show a fixed eight-way D-pad while driving and route button presses through the existing touch joystick input mapping. Keep normal touch controls unchanged outside vehicle operation.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
